type: software

title: "pup-clean"
# Set version and date-released to match latest git tag or release.
version: "0.0.5"
date-released: "2026-08-09"

authors:
  - family-names: Case
    given-names: Denise M.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6165-7389"
    affiliation: "Northwest Missouri State University, School of Computer Science and Information Systems, Maryville, MO, USA"

repository-code: "https://github.com/denisecase/pup-clean"
url: "https://github.com/denisecase/pup-clean"

license: MIT

abstract: >
  Command-line tool for preparing a professional Python teaching repository
  for student use by removing instructor-generated evidence and artifacts.
  pup-clean removes known development residue such as project.log and
  discovers project-specific generated artifacts by inspecting Python source
  code, allowing the instructor repository to be cleaned before release as
  a student project template.

keywords:
